  "question": {
    "text": "If a fully charged capacitor C with initial charge <math><msub><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> is connected to a coil of self inductance <math><mi>L</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> . The time at which the energy is stored equally between the electric field and magnetic field is",
